  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your powerful hexes can be spread around with elan.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Split Major Hex<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The second target of your Split Major Hex may be up to 30 feet plus 20 feet per mythic tier from the first target. In addition, you may choose which target must save against the major hex first. If the first target’s save is successful, the second target takes a -2 penalty on its save.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc81\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
